    "description": "Mazlum is a man who lives in the Esenler neighborhood and works as a singer in a nightclub despite his limited knowledge of music. Every night, he arrives at the venue with his own poster from the 90s tucked under his arm. Since this is the last poster he has left, he treats it like his own eye, hanging it on the club's bulletin board himself. He makes his own announcements from backstage. Despite having an extremely naive personality, he appears cunning, flirtatious, and impulsive to outsiders.",
